{"id":"estructura-basica-dun-document-html","title":"Estructura bàsica d'un document HTML","topic":"html","topicLabel":"HTML","tags":["aprendizaje","Html"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":0.5,"words":63,"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>Tot fitxer web ha de tenir una estructura mínima: el <code>DOCTYPE</code> (per indicar que és HTML5), l&#39;etiqueta arrel <code>&lt;html&gt;</code>, la capçalera <code>&lt;head&gt;</code> (per a informació no visible com el títol o metadades) i el cos <code>&lt;body&gt;</code> (on va tot el contingut visible).</p>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">Html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">&lt;!DOCTYPE <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">html</span>&gt;</span> \n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">html</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">lang</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;ca&quot;</span>&gt;</span> \n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span>&gt;</span> \n\t<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">meta</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">charset</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;UTF-8&quot;</span>&gt;</span> \n\t<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">title</span>&gt;</span>El meu lloc web<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">title</span>&gt;</span> \n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span>&gt;</span> \n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span> \n\t<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>Benvinguts<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h1</span>&gt;</span> \n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>&gt;</span> \n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">html</span>&gt;</span> [cite: 443-453]</code></pre></div>"}